export const html = "<h1>Counter Setup Guide</h1>\n      <hr class=\"rule\" />\n      <p>The Counter application counts the number of AI-detected objects and defines a range of actions that make use of the resulting counts. Learn about the types of counting-based applications, how to configure counters, and how to make use of the API and visualize data.</p>\n\n      <h2>How the Counter Works</h2>\n      \n<div class=\"figure\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 380\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\">\n  <rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"450\" height=\"290\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c7cbd6\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#4a4f5c\" font-weight=\"700\">AI Bridge</text>\n  <rect x=\"30\" y=\"60\" width=\"120\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f2f3f6\" stroke=\"#9aa0ac\"/>\n  <text x=\"90\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#3a3f4a\">Count&#8321;&#8321;</text>\n  <rect x=\"30\" y=\"105\" width=\"120\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f2f3f6\" stroke=\"#9aa0ac\"/>\n  <text x=\"90\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#3a3f4a\">Count&#8321;&#8322;</text>\n  <rect x=\"30\" y=\"150\" width=\"120\" height=\"34\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f2f3f6\" stroke=\"#9aa0ac\"/>\n  <text x=\"90\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#3a3f4a\">Count&#8321;&#8323;</text>\n  <text x=\"90\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#5b6270\">&#8942;</text>\n\n  <rect x=\"290\" y=\"80\" width=\"120\" height=\"90\" rx=\"60\" fill=\"#dbe6fb\" stroke=\"#8ea9df\"/>\n  <text x=\"350\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1b3a7a\">Data Store</text>\n\n  <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"77\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#8a8f9c\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" marker-end=\"url(#arr4)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"125\" stroke=\"#8a8f9c\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" marker-end=\"url(#arr4)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"167\" x2=\"290\" y2=\"135\" stroke=\"#8a8f9c\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" marker-end=\"url(#arr4)\"/>\n\n  <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"320\" stroke=\"#8a8f9c\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" marker-end=\"url(#arr4)\"/>\n  <text x=\"98\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5b6270\">Local API</text>\n\n  <line x1=\"410\" y1=\"125\" x2=\"560\" y2=\"125\" stroke=\"#8a8f9c\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\" marker-end=\"url(#arr4)\"/>\n  <ellipse cx=\"630\" cy=\"125\" rx=\"65\" ry=\"30\" fill=\"#dcefe0\" stroke=\"#7fbf95\"/>\n  <text x=\"630\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#20603a\">Cloud Server</text>\n  <line x1=\"695\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"780\" y2=\"105\" stroke=\"#8a8f9c\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" marker-end=\"url(#arr4)\"/>\n  <text x=\"720\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5b6270\">Visualization</text>\n  <line x1=\"630\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"630\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"#8a8f9c\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" marker-end=\"url(#arr4)\"/>\n  <text x=\"638\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5b6270\">Cloud API</text>\n  <defs><marker id=\"arr4\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#8a8f9c\"/></marker></defs>\n</svg>\n<figcaption>How the counter works</figcaption>\n</div>\n\n      <p>Once a counter application is configured, the AI Bridge counts objects internally and stores the counting data to internal storage at a set interval.</p>\n      <p>Stored data can be queried directly via the API on the edge. Edge storage is subject to limits around retention period, network configuration, and service capacity.</p>\n      <p>Using the cloud application (<a href=\"https://cloud.indoai.com\">https://cloud.indoai.com</a>) isn't required, but doing so frees you from the edge device's limitations. It lets you retain data for a longer period and use the API from anywhere without network constraints.</p>\n      <p>Or, you can use the visualization examples the cloud application provides directly.</p>\n      \n<div class=\"figure\">\n  <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;\">\n    <div class=\"app-panel\" style=\"padding:10px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);\">TOTAL VISITOR COUNT</div><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;\">420</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--green);\">+10%</div></div>\n    <div class=\"app-panel\" style=\"padding:10px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);\">AVG. OCCUPANCY</div><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;\">7</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--green);\">+40%</div></div>\n    <div class=\"app-panel\" style=\"padding:10px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);\">MAX OCCUPANCY</div><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;\">31</div></div>\n    <div class=\"app-panel\" style=\"padding:10px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);\">CURR OCCUPIED</div><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;\">0</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#d64545;\">-0%</div></div>\n    <div class=\"app-panel\" style=\"padding:10px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);\">CUSTOMER VISIT</div><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;\">279</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--green);\">+40</div></div>\n    <div class=\"app-panel\" style=\"padding:10px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);\">TRAFFIC AROUND</div><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;\">1984</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--green);\">+450</div></div>\n    <div class=\"app-panel\" style=\"padding:10px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);\">VISIT RATE</div><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;\">14.1%</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--green);\">+1%</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;\">\n    <div class=\"app-panel\" style=\"padding:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:6px;\">OCCUPANCY TREND</div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 140 60\" width=\"100%\" height=\"60\"><polyline points=\"0,50 20,30 40,35 60,15 80,25 100,10 120,20 140,5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f9e6e\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></div>\n    <div class=\"app-panel\" style=\"padding:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:6px;\">IN/OUT COUNT</div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 140 60\" width=\"100%\" height=\"60\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"20\" width=\"8\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#8ea9df\"/><rect x=\"18\" y=\"10\" width=\"8\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#f0c26b\"/><rect x=\"31\" y=\"25\" width=\"8\" height=\"35\" fill=\"#8ea9df\"/><rect x=\"44\" y=\"15\" width=\"8\" height=\"45\" fill=\"#f0c26b\"/><rect x=\"57\" y=\"30\" width=\"8\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#8ea9df\"/></svg></div>\n    <div class=\"app-panel\" style=\"padding:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:6px;\">CUSTOMER VISIT TO TRAFFIC</div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 140 60\" width=\"100%\" height=\"60\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"20\" width=\"6\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#f0c26b\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"10\" width=\"6\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#f0c26b\"/><rect x=\"27\" y=\"25\" width=\"6\" height=\"35\" fill=\"#f0c26b\"/><rect x=\"38\" y=\"15\" width=\"6\" height=\"45\" fill=\"#f0c26b\"/></svg></div>\n    <div class=\"app-panel\" style=\"padding:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:6px;\">VISIT RATE</div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 140 60\" width=\"100%\" height=\"60\"><polyline points=\"0,40 20,20 40,45 60,10 80,30 100,15 120,35 140,20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5b6bd6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n      <h2>Counter Setup Guide</h2>\n      <h2 style=\"margin-top:20px;\">Counter Setup</h2>\n      <p>Set up a counter to count people or vehicles in a specific area, or to automatically count objects crossing a reference line.</p>\n      <p>&#8251; See the <a href=\"/counter-example\">Counter Setup Example</a> for details.</p>\n\n      <h2>Event Action Settings</h2>\n      <p>You can set up events based on a configured counter's values and generate a variety of action rules.</p>\n      <p>Send an alert or automatically perform an action when a specific condition is met or on a recurring interval.</p>\n      <p>Each counter app includes a separate menu for configuring rules.</p>\n      <p>&#8251; See the <a href=\"/counter-action-rule-setting\">Counter Event Action Setup Example</a> for details.</p>\n\n      <h2>Report Settings</h2>\n      <p>Counted data can be sent periodically as CSV or JSON files via HTTP, FTP, Email, or AWS S3, on a schedule you configure.</p>\n      <p>You can receive individual counter values, or combine all of a counter app's values into a single file.</p>\n      <p>Each counter app includes a separate menu for configuring reports.</p>\n      <p>&#8251; See the <a href=\"/report-setting\">Periodic Report Usage Guide</a> for details.</p>\n\n      <h2>Counter Use Cases</h2>\n      <ul class=\"steps\">\n        <li><strong>Traffic Management</strong> &ndash; count vehicles on highways and at intersections to track congestion in real time and optimize traffic flow.</li>\n        <li><strong>Foot Traffic Analysis</strong> &ndash; count foot traffic in key areas such as shopping malls and public spaces to understand density by time of day and inform facility operations and resource placement.</li>\n        <li><strong>Visitor Analysis</strong> &ndash; analyze visitor counts at stores, expos, and museums to understand peak hours, visit patterns, and congestion by zone, improving operational efficiency.</li>\n        <li><strong>Parking Management</strong> &ndash; count vehicles in a parking lot to track available spaces in real time and, for example, close entry once full, for more efficient operation.</li>\n        <li><strong>Safety Management</strong> &ndash; detect people trapped in a hazardous area for an extended period so you can respond quickly in an emergency.</li>\n      </ul>";
